/div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex border-b border-[#0F191E]/20 py-5 group sidebar-list-item cursor-crosshair\">\n                    <div class=\"w-16 font-mono text-xs opacity-50 pt-1\">02.</div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline justify-between gap-4\">\n                        <h4 class=\"font-semibold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest w-32\">Structure</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs opacity-70 max-w-xs leading-relaxed group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Design architecture for brand systems and layouts. Live mockups, proportions, and balance metrics.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-4 bg-[#0F191E] ml-4 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex border-b border-[#0F191E]/20 py-5 group sidebar-list-item cursor-crosshair\">\n                    <div class=\"w-16 font-mono text-xs opacity-50 pt-1\">03.</div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline justify-between gap-4\">\n                        <h4 class=\"font-semibold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest w-32\">Identity</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs opacity-70 max-w-xs leading-relaxed group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Interactive review with identity experts. Symbol testing, brand usage, visual guidelines.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-4 bg-[#0F191E] ml-4 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex py-5 group sidebar-list-item cursor-crosshair\">\n                    <div class=\"w-16 font-mono text-xs opacity-50 pt-1\">04.</div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline justify-between gap-4\">\n                        <h4 class